name: ['Arena Rector', 'Birthing Pod', 'Demonic Tutor', 'Enlightened Tutor', 'Eye of Ugin', 'Gamble', 'Infernal Tutor', 'Spellseeker', 'Sterling Grove', 'Sylvan Tutor']
